What does this program print?

```dart
mixin A { String hi() => 'A'; }
mixin B { String hi() => 'B'; }
class Base { String hi() => 'Base'; }
class C extends Base with A, B {}
class D extends Base with B, A {}

void main() => print('${C().hi()}${D().hi()}');
```

What does this program print?

```dart
class Ticket {
  static int issued = 0;
  final int number;
  Ticket() : number = ++issued;
}

void main() {
  final a = Ticket();
  final b = Ticket();
  final c = Ticket();
  print(a.number + b.number * 10 + c.number * 100);
}
```
